      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_feather",
      "text": "You go home, put Jenny's feather in your old book, and start running again the next morning. Just because. Some things don't need a reason.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Feather",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Feather"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_father",
      "text": "You raise Little Forrest into a kind, smart man. He becomes a teacher. You watch him from a back row at his graduation and cry exactly once, in a Forrest way, big and honest.",
