      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Little Forrest's Years"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_chocolates",
      "text": "Mama was right. You never know what you're going to get. You eat the chocolates as they come. The bench, in town, is still there. Some days you sit on it.",
